  "description": "##  接口描述\n\n用于用户自行登录获取税局Cookie后，通过该接口直接上传税局有效Cookie进行登录。",
  "operationId": "",
  "sourceUrl": "",
  "method": "post",
  "path": "/v2/public/login/ext/uploadTokenByAccountId",
  "tags": [],
  "status": "released",
  "requestBody": {
